[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21184.67, "timestamp": "05:53:04", "text": "粘贴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21190.708, "timestamp": "05:53:10", "text": "呃，好的。等等，我需要哪一个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21193.44, "timestamp": "05:53:13", "text": "再次改变？哦，那会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21195.708, "timestamp": "05:53:15", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21211.07, "timestamp": "05:53:31", "text": "好的。好的。我只是需要这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21213.788, "timestamp": "05:53:33", "text": "呃，这一点与此不同。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21216.708, "timestamp": "05:53:36", "text": "再次。哦，最下面那个是确认。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21218.788, "timestamp": "05:53:38", "text": "好的。最需要修改的那一个，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21221.8, "timestamp": "05:53:41", "text": "好的，明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21223.15, "timestamp": "05:53:43", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21226.31, "timestamp": "05:53:46", "text": "嗯，只有当我有稳定的视频流时才这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21227.31, "timestamp": "05:53:47", "text": "甲板，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21230.23, "timestamp": "05:53:50", "text": "男人。如果我有更大的或者别的什么，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21232.99, "timestamp": "05:53:52", "text": "那本来会是"}]